ght rides your record line next time.\n\n**Sauna.** Take the ladle, dip it in the bucket and throw l\u00f6yly on the hot stones. Hear the hiss, watch the steam rise and the thermometer climb. Add a log to the stove, dim the lamp, and switch on the old radio.\n\n**Meet Santa** in his sleigh at the top of the hill and open a present.\n\n**Comfort note: this game moves you downhill at speed and can cause motion sickness.** The horizon always stays level, there's no camera bob, top speed and turning are gently limited, and you can play seated.\n\nSports: sledge, skis, snowboard, snowshoes. Six hills, from gentle blue to steep black.\n\nTerrain: Copernicus DEM GLO-30, \u00a9 DLR e.V. 2010-2014 and \u00a9 Airbus Defence and Space GmbH 2014-2018, provided under COPERNICUS by the European Union and ESA. (The licence requires this credit line in the store description.)", "short_description": "Sledge, ski and snowboard real Finnish fells, light lanterns, and warm up in a wood-fired sauna.\n"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://nebulytic.com/apps/nordic-winter/privacy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "https://nebulytic.com/apps/nordic-winter/terms", "publisher_name": "Nebulytic", "support_website_url": "https://nebulytic.com/apps/nordic-winter/support", "website_url": "https://nebulytic.com/apps/nordic-winter/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "2776542286000603"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING", "STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interactio